{"asset_key":"ep5/herohub_story_15411100","episode":"ep5","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"15411100","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1541110001:1":{"text":"Merlin, what's that in your hand?","source_cn":"梅林，拿着的是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90AD753B2FDF02AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1541110002:1":{"text":"These are raw flints from a human village called Oreton. Picked them up on my travels across Esperia.","source_cn":"这些是生矿燧石，来自一座名为“生矿”的人类小村，是我游...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B981325A8098B36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1541110003:1":{"text":"The village hugs the mountainside. They mine the rock for ore, and flint comes out in the process.","source_cn":"生矿村依山而建，以开采山体内的矿石为生。燧石是开采的副产物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AB38C9521DA2304","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1541110004:1":{"text":"Flint... what's that?","source_cn":"“燧石”……是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09972AB19C58CEF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1541110005:1":{"text":"It's a stone you can strike together to make sparks. Old-school fire starter.","source_cn":"燧石就是用于取火的石头。两块燧石相碰，便可以燃起火焰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDE33BE210A77CC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1541110006:1":{"text":"I think the Wildborn folks usually call it \"fire rock.\"","source_cn":"我记得，雅库伯尔人更习惯称它为“火块”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FC8A141186A4EF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1541110007:1":{"text":"Right, fire rock. Rings a bell.","source_cn":"嗯，火块。加拉知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3840780455F46E76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1541110008:1":{"text":"But it looks different from the ones we use.","source_cn":"燧石和火块，看起来不太一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC982BAFB1C89CAB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1541110009:1":{"text":"That's because it's mined from deep underground. It's purer than the Wildborn's and a lot darker too.","source_cn":"生矿燧石源于山体深处，纯度比雅库伯尔常见的火块更高，因...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87234ECB2DD6C322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1541110010:1":{"text":"If you don't store it properly, it can catch fire on its own. Safer to keep it soaked in water, then dry it out when you need it.","source_cn":"若是存储不当，很容易引发火势。所以最好将它浸在水中，需...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE948803937199AB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1541110011:1":{"text":"But you didn't keep yours in water.","source_cn":"可是，你没有把它泡在水里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10406B3598743B81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1541110012:1":{"text":"Are mages not afraid of fire?","source_cn":"魔法师，不怕火吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D09FE29F50C1024","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1541110013:1":{"text":"It's not that. We just have better ways of handling it. Like enchanting the flint to keep it damp.","source_cn":"怎么会不怕呢？只不过，比起浸泡在水中，魔法师有更好的解...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2278E464B1455AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1541110014:1":{"text":"Or burying it in sand. That's how the Oreton villagers store it too.","source_cn":"再比如，将它们藏在沙子里——这也是生矿村的储藏方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF4C5CD0FFE0731F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1541110015:1":{"text":"You pick up a few things when you travel the world, don't you think?","source_cn":"在游历世界的同时，总归需要学习一些什么，不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFDC17010670021B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:加拉":{"text":"Gala","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"Merlin the First","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":2}}